{"about_the_game":"<strong>Scan. Bag. Smile. Repeat.</strong>  <br><strong>Next In Line</strong> is a cozy cashier simulator where you work the checkout at a friendly neighborhood supermarket.  <br>Scan items, bag groceries, and serve a stream of quirky customers\u2014all while managing discounts, coupons, and the occasional chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/577b7c72604ca1b6c6f16432a03d43bc.poster.avif?t=1774501497\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/577b7c72604ca1b6c6f16432a03d43bc.webm?t=1774501497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/577b7c72604ca1b6c6f16432a03d43bc.mp4?t=1774501497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83d\uded2 Your Daily Shift, Your Cozy Routine</strong>  <br>Each day brings a fresh wave of customers with new items, requests, and surprises. Swipe barcodes, apply promos, print receipts, and handle payments with precision. Every action feels satisfying, from the beep of the scanner to the perfect grocery bag Tetris.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/a865a433805a9246efcdc11fc634f18a.poster.avif?t=1774501497\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/a865a433805a9246efcdc11fc634f18a.webm?t=1774501497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/a865a433805a9246efcdc11fc634f18a.mp4?t=1774501497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ol><li>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Scan &amp; Bag:</strong> Place items on the scanner with satisfying mini-games, then fit them neatly into bags using limited space.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Handle Payments:</strong> Accept cash or card, give exact change, or swipe cards just right.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Price Checks:</strong> Pause to look up item prices, weigh produce, and print custom labels.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f <strong>Apply Discounts:</strong> Match valid coupons and take advantage of daily promotions.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Express Lane:</strong> Handle impatient customers with fewer items in a fast-paced version of your shift.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade &amp; Customize:</strong> Unlock new aisles like bakery or frozen foods, improve your scanner, and collect fun extras like receipt themes and stickers.</li></ol><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/49dbc7f35d5d9248626c2d3ce68e6716.poster.avif?t=1774501497\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/49dbc7f35d5d9248626c2d3ce68e6716.webm?t=1774501497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extras/49dbc7f35d5d9248626c2d3ce68e6716.mp4?t=1774501497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u2728 Cozy Vibes, Satisfying Flow</strong>  <br>Hand-drawn visuals, ambient store sounds, and charming customer interactions make every shift feel like a warm, slice-of-life experience. Inspired by <i>Lost But Found</i>, but with a cashier twist.<br><br><strong>Can you keep the line moving and everyone happy?</strong>  <br>Punch in and find out\u2014there\u2019s always someone <i>Next In Line</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894830/extr